os_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":341,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T03:07:42Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-02-23T19:43:40Z","updated_at":"2026-06-18T18:21:13Z","closed_at":"2026-06-18T18:19:42Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nv4.6.1.stable.official [14d19694e]\nv4.5.1.stable.mono.official [f62fdbde1]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.1.stable - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Single-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5070 Ti (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9174) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-9900 CPU @ 3.10GHz (16 threads) - 31.93 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nUsing RenderDoc, I noticed that mesh particles from GPUParticles3D cause draw calls in the shadow pass even though they never emitted.\n\nThe MRP..:\n\n- Has one `GPUParticles3D` with a `BoxMesh` as draw pass 1 and `Amount` set to 200. \n- The `Emitting` property is turned off. \n- `ProcessMaterial` does not matter.\n- There's one `DirectionalLight3D` which has `PSSM 4 Splits` shadows enabled.\n\nThis causes 4 vkCmdDrawIndexed invokations as seen here:\n\n<img width=\"222\" height=\"340\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a84183ed-b7c5-4da5-9be4-8651a123ff83\" />\n\nNotably, there are no such calls for them in \"Render Depth Prepass\" or \"Render Opaque\".\n\n**Expected:**\nThere should be no draw calls in any pass, unless the particle system is emitting.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- RenderDoc (or a similar tool?) is needed to inspect the calls to the vulkan api.\n- At any time, it shows that the non-emitting particles cause draw calls in the shadow pass only.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[MRP_particles_in_shadow_pass.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25498619/MRP_particles_in_shadow_pass.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116682/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116682/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}